  <page_number>79</page_number>
  <running_head>EPIGRAMMATA.</running_head>
  <bottom_margin>
    <catchword />
    <signature />
  </bottom_margin>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" para="true">
      <i>Maeoritis opem petit cruentus</i>
    </l>
    <l n="2" para="true">
      <i>iles, follitus sua salutis:</i>
    </l>
    <l n="3" para="true">
      <i>vidni, Calliope, tibi tuisque</i>
    </l>
    <l n="4" para="true">
      <i>re sacra feram, quibus placere</i>
    </l>
    <l n="5" para="true">
      <i>st Gnum studium mihi, omnibusque</i>
    </l>
    <l n="6" para="true">
      <i>ui Satum e numero Solunt haberi?</i>
    </l>
    <l n="7" para="true">
      <i>obis ergo ferenda sacra, Musa.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="8" para="true">
      <i>d qua Victima grata? qua Camoenis</i>
    </l>
    <l n="9" para="true">
      <i>icata hostia? parcite, o Camoena:</i>
    </l>
    <l n="10" para="true">
      <i>oua hac Victima, sed futura Sobis</i>
    </l>
    <l n="11" para="true">
      <i>tauis, arbitror, admodumque grata.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="12" para="true">
      <i>ccede, o tinea, illa qua pusillo</i>
    </l>
    <l n="13" para="true">
      <i>entrem corpore tam geris Soracem.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="14" para="true">
      <i>ne Pieridum aggredi ministros?</i>
    </l>
    <l n="15" para="true">
      <i>ne arrodere tam sacros labores?</i>
    </l>
    <l n="16" para="true">
      <i>ec factum mihi denega. Ecce furti</i>
    </l>
    <l n="17" para="true">
      <i>ui exempla, tua &amp; Soracitatis:</i>
    </l>
    <l n="18" para="true">
      <i>ne tu mihi passerem Catulli,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="19" para="true">
      <i>ne tu mihi Lesbiam abstuliflti.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="20" para="true">
      <i>lunc certe meus ille Martialis</i>
    </l>
    <l n="21" para="true">
      <i>na ad Visecera rosus Sque languet:</i>
    </l>
    <l n="22" para="true">
      <i>mmo &amp; ipse Maro, cui peperci-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="23">
      <i>t,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="24" para="true">
      <i>sto Casare sic iubente, flamma,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="25" para="true">
      <i>afus dente tuo, scelecтa, maret:</i>
    </l>
    <l n="26" para="true">
      <i>uid dicam innumeros bene eruditus,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="27" para="true">
      <i>uorum tu monimenta, tu labores</i>
    </l>
    <l n="28" para="true">
      <i>fo pesfimo Sentre devorasti?</i>
    </l>
    <l n="29" para="true">
      <i>rodi, iam tunicam relinque, prodi.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="30" para="true">
      <i>ah, St callida stringit ipsa fese!</i>
    </l>
  </main_text>
  <notes>Marginal decorations and scan edge marks are not text. Several words in the italic long-s and ligature forms are uncertain, notably the lines beginning "Maeoritis", "uidni", "oua", "Visecera", "scelecтa", and "fese"; these are transcribed as best read and may contain errors.</notes>
